  </section>

  <SourcesStandards lang="en" ids={['oshaH2s', 'nioshH2s', 'acgihH2s']} />

  <section class="block">
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--fog);max-width:700px;">This page is educational reference material, not a substitute for certified H₂S safety training. In an actual H₂S exposure or well-control emergency, follow your site's emergency response plan and alert your supervisor and gas-testing personnel immediately — do not rely on this page for real-time decisions.</p>
  </section>
